6. **Challenges in Retrieval Effectiveness**: The paper identifies challenges such as misinterpretation of user queries and the ineffectiveness of retrieval methods, which can lead to irrelevant or inappropriate content being retrieved [rag-retrieval-review_chunk_0025]. 

